{"id": "RT-guide-static-understand-fatigue-sleep", "body": {"t": "main", "a": {"id": "main-content", "class": "wrap"}, "c": [{"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD home"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/"}, "c": ["Guidebook"]}]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/"}, "c": ["MJB ADHD"]}, " · Static reading view · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/#/n/fatigue-sleep"}, "c": ["Interactive version"]}]}, {"t": "h1", "c": ["Fatigue, sleepiness and sleep disruption"]}, {"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "small", "c": ["Status: sourced · Content checked 2026-10-06"]}]}, {"t": "p", "a": {"class": "lede"}, "c": ["Being sleepy, running out of energy and finding it difficult to start a task are different experiences. A useful appointment describes which occurs, when and with what other symptoms."]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "1"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Quick understanding"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N8", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Persistent fatigue can have several causes, including disrupted sleep, medicines and medical conditions. It should not automatically be attributed to ADHD."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N8"}, "c": ["N8"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "2"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Possible explanations"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N8", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Loud snoring with gasping or choking during sleep, persistent thirst, weight change or breathlessness are examples of associated symptoms that can guide assessment."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N8"}, "c": ["N8"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "3"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Useful next action"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Keep a short record of sleep opportunity, awakenings, daytime sleepiness and activities limited by fatigue. Bring medication and substance timing. Ask whether examination or tests are appropriate."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "4"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Treatment logic"]}, {"t": "div", "a": {"class": "claim", "data-label": "guidance", "data-conf": ""}, "c": [{"t": "button", "a": {"class": "chip chip-guidance", "type": "button", "data-label": "guidance", "data-srcs": "N8", "data-conf": "", "aria-label": "Clinical guidance: show sources"}, "c": ["Clinical guidance"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Seek a GP assessment when fatigue persists for weeks without a clear reason or interferes with daily life. Treatment depends on the cause."]}, {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N8"}, "c": ["N8"]}]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "5"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Deeper explanation"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["The aim is a useful plan, not a perfect diary. Choose two or three observations you can repeat without exhausting yourself."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "a": {"class": "layer", "data-guide-layer": "6"}, "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Evidence and onward routes"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Clinical information: ", {"t": "span", "a": {"class": "refs"}, "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"class": "ref", "href": "/guide/static/about/sources/#src-N8"}, "c": ["N8"]}]}, ". These are institutional explainers; the page is sourced, not independently medically reviewed."]}, " ", {"t": "p", "c": ["For abrupt new neurological symptoms, use urgent medical assessment rather than this reading route."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Useful questions"]}, {"t": "ul", "c": [{"t": "li", "c": ["Am I describing sleepiness, fatigue, initiation difficulty or a combination?"]}, {"t": "li", "c": ["What needs investigation and what support can begin meanwhile?"]}]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Uncertainty"]}, {"t": "p", "c": ["Feeling better after a stimulant does not establish the original cause of fatigue. This page does not recommend using a substance to test a diagnosis."]}]}, " ", {"t": "section", "c": [{"t": "h2", "c": ["Sources cited"]}, {"t": "ol", "c": [{"t": "li", "a": {"id": "src-N8"}, "c": [{"t": "b", "c": ["N8"]}, " NHS — Tiredness and fatigue ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "https://www.nhs.uk/symptoms/tiredness-and-fatigue/"}, "c": ["link"]}, " ", {"t": "i", "c": ["(Webpage read; not an independent systematic review)"]}]}]}]}, {"t": "nav", "c": [{"t": "p", "c": [{"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/tools/appointment-preparation/"}, "c": ["Next action: Prepare for an appointment"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/understand/pain-fatigue-movement/"}, "c": ["Related: Pain, fatigue and movement"]}, " · ", {"t": "a", "a": {"href": "/guide/static/evidence/open-questions/"}, "c": ["Deeper: Open research questions"]}]}]}]}}